          "Code": "ESCB0051",
          "GiataCode": "335026",
          "Name": "Avenida Apartments",
          "Description": "<p>The Avenida Apartments put you in a prime spot in Benidorm Old Town, where you&rsquo;ll find a myriad of charming tapas bars. It&rsquo;s also close to Levante Beach, a never-ending sandy stretch freckled with chiringuito bars.</p>\n<p>Stay here and you&rsquo;ll get full access to the facilities at Hotel Avenida Benidorm, which is just across the road. These include a rooftop swimming pool and whirlpool with stunning sea views, a fitness centre and a restaurant serving round-the-world buffet dishes. You get to fully enjoy the entertainment programme, too, which ticks off bingo, quizzes and karaoke sessions in a stylish lounge bar.</p>\n<p>This building is made up of apartments and a reception area, and the apartments are spacious with cool tiled floors and neutral colour schemes. Each comes with a lounge and dining area, plus a kitchenette complete with cooking rings, a toaster and a microwave. You&rsquo;ll find a few supermarkets close by, so it&rsquo;s easy to stock up and enjoy meals in as a group or a family.</p>",
